FP4.smarts
==========

The SMARTS patterns in FP4.smarts are the functional group classification
patterns written by Christian Laggner, distributed with Open Babel as
data/SMARTS_InteLigand.txt and used there to define the FP4 fingerprint.
UManSysProp originally read them through Pybel; AeroSysProp keeps the
patterns and evaluates them with RDKit.

Original notice:

    SMARTS Patterns for Functional Group Classification
    written by Christian Laggner
